This repository includes material derived from GeoAnalystBench
(https://github.com/GeoDS/GeoAnalystBench), described in

  Zhang, Q., Gao, S., Wei, C., Zhao, Y., Nie, Y., Chen, Z., Chen, S., Su, Y., Sun, H. (2025).
  GeoAnalystBench: A GeoAI benchmark for assessing large language models for spatial
  analysis workflow and code generation. Transactions in GIS, 29(7), e70135.

and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (a copy is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0):

- benchmark/tasks.csv and benchmark/perturbations/tasks.csv: the task table of the
  benchmark. The columns Instruction, Domain Knowledge and Dataset Description were
  revised for part of the tasks; the other columns are unchanged. The column with the
  benchmark's reference code is not included.
- Files under benchmark/specs/ whose header states "Adapted from the reference script of
  GeoAnalystBench": reference or control solutions based on the benchmark's published
  reference scripts.

The input data of the benchmark are not part of this repository.
